      "value": "@{5e877e5e60de627e6ba7946a|full_name}: My idea was for if the clamping in the UI was going to stick around. I was totally surprised by the simple input box which works so much better! Now a user can just type \"1/0\" or \"Inf\" and it just works.™ This should probably be noted in the physbone documentation.\n\nThanks!",
